gine/godot/issues/comments/3307746169","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109257#issuecomment-3307746169","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109257","id":3307746169,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FKDN5","user":{"login":"Amandella27","id":112986970,"node_id":"U_kgDOBrwLWg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112986970?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amandella27","html_url":"https://github.com/Amandella27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amandella27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amandella27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amandella27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amandella27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amandella27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amandella27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amandella27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amandella27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amandella27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T14:22:26Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T14:22:26Z","body":"Just wanted to chime in and say after migrating a complex project to 4.5 I am now seeing the same or similar error. There's no obvious effect on running the game so far. I've attempted to read through this thread and do other research but no success so far.\n\nThe error occurs when the game loads a new scene using our \"Loader\" autoload.\n\nWill gladly provide any other information that might be helpful.\n\nType mismatch between initial and final value: float and bool\n  <C++ Error>   Method/function failed. Returning: false\n  <C++ Source>  scene/resources/animation.cpp:5688 @ validate_type_match()","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3307746169/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3317584488","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109257#issuecomment-3317584488","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109257","id":3317584488,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FvlJo","user":{"login":"xsellier","id":6616005,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTYwMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6616005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsellier","html_url":"https://github.com/xsellier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsellier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsellier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsellier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsellier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsellier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsellier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsellier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsellier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsellier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-22T08:38:20Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T08:38:20Z","body":"I got the very same error, and find out that the OneShot trigger has changed. See the doc:\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/animation/animation_tree.html#oneshot","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3317584488/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"http